      compiler/ori_arc/src/aims/contract/tests.rs
      and adjacent test modules. Coverage rows:

        Row J1: join_with_bottom_returns_other —
                join(OPTIMISTIC, c) = c for any c; verifies
                bottom identity (consequence of (P9) first
                clause with p = OPTIMISTIC)
        Row J2: join_with_top_returns_top —
                join(CONSERVATIVE, c) = CONSERVATIVE for any c;
                verifies top absorption (max-join property of
                top element)
        Row J3: per_dim_advance_access —
                join((Borrowed, ...), (Owned, ...)) =
                (Owned, ...); (P1) per-dim pin
        Row J4: per_dim_advance_consumption —
                similar for Consumption; (P2) per-dim pin
        Row J5: per_dim_advance_cardinality —
