      Coverage axes:
        Per-dim correctness (P1)..(P6):
          Rows J3..J8 directly pin each dimension
        Lattice properties (P7)..(P9):
          Rows J9, J10, J11 directly pin each property;
          property-based testing over randomized inputs
          gives statistical confidence beyond the manually-
          enumerated unit cases
        Identity / absorption boundaries:
          Rows J1, J2 pin bottom-identity + top-absorption
        Multi-iteration soundness:
          Row J12 pins the IC-3 join's role inside the SCC
          fixpoint loop
        Canonicalization interaction:
          Row J13 pins L-8 (canonicalize preserves join)

      Lattice-property rows J9, J10, J11 belong to the §02
      lattice-property proofs (L-1, L-2, L-6) and are
      cross-referenced here as cross-section coverage; the
      proof-checker corpus exercises them via the same engine
